WEBVTT

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:30.621
no cuando le dice al refugiado, "Vete",

00:10:30.621 --> 00:10:34.608
sino,"Está bien,
ya estás aquí, estás a salvo".

00:10:35.112 --> 00:10:36.275
Gracias.

00:10:36.299 --> 00:10:39.124
(Aplausos)

00:10:39.148 --> 00:10:40.354
Gracias.

00:10:40.378 --> 00:10:41.739
(Aplausos)